{"book":10,"chapter":33,"rubric":"LEARNING RUST / ASYNCHRONY / CHAPTER 33","slides":[{"title":"What is tokio","sub":"Chapter 33 · Runtime","short":"Intro","main":"Scheduler, I/O, timers, blocking pool; flags.","body":[{"t":"scene","labels":["Components","Flags","full"],"captions":["Task scheduler, I/O driver, timers, blocking-task pool","Flags: rt, rt-multi-thread, macros, time, net, io-util, fs, sync, signal, process","In examples: features = [\"full\"]; in projects, be more precise to cut build time"],"frames":[[{"t":"cell","id":"a0","x":50.0,"y":66.0,"w":76.0,"h":30.0,"text":"scheduler","tone":"blue","size":9.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"a1","x":136.0,"y":66.0,"w":76.0,"h":30.0,"text":"I/O","tone":"blue","size":9.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"a2","x":222.0,"y":66.0,"w":76.0,"h":30.0,"text":"timers","tone":"blue","size":9.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"a3","x":308.0,"y":66.0,"w":76.0,"h":30.0,"text":"blocking","tone":"blue","size":9.0,"sub_size":8.5}],[{"t":"cell","id":"a0","x":50.0,"y":66.0,"w":76.0,"h":30.0,"text":"rt","tone":"green","size":10.5,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"a1","x":136.0,"y":66.0,"w":76.0,"h":30.0,"text":"time","tone":"green","size":10.5,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"a2","x":222.0,"y":66.0,"w":76.0,"h":30.0,"text":"net","tone":"green","size":10.5,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"a3","x":308.0,"y":66.0,"w":76.0,"h":30.0,"text":"sync","tone":"green","size":10.5,"sub_size":8.5}],[{"t":"code","id":"c","x":20.0,"y":50.0,"lines":["tokio = { version = \"1\", features = [\"full\"] }"],"hl":[0],"lang":"rust","size":9.5,"lh":28.0,"w":340.0}]],"cues":[13.8,31.1]}]},{"title":"#[tokio::main]","sub":"Macro","short":"main","main":"Creates the runtime and calls block_on; flavor; #[tokio::test].","body":[{"t":"scene","labels":["Macro","Parameters","#[tokio::test]"],"captions":["async fn main() cannot be the real main: the macro creates a runtime and calls block_on","flavor = \"current_thread\" | \"multi_thread\", worker_threads = N, start_paused = true","#[tokio::test] does the same for each test; single-threaded runtime by default"],"frames":[[{"t":"code","id":"c","x":20.0,"y":40.0,"lines":["#[tokio::main]","async fn main() { … }"],"hl":[0],"lang":"rust","size":12.0,"lh":26.0,"w":340.0}],[{"t":"code","id":"c","x":20.0,"y":40.0,"lines":["#[tokio::main(flavor = \"multi_thread\", worker_threads = 4)]"],"hl":[0],"lang":"rust","size":8.5,"lh":28.0,"w":340.0}],[{"t":"code","id":"c","x":20.0,"y":50.0,"lines":["#[tokio::test]","async fn works() { assert_eq!(f().await, 5); }"],"hl":[0],"lang":"rust","size":10.0,"lh":28.0,"w":340.0}]],"cues":[13.9,26.5]}]},{"title":"Runtime flavors","sub":"multi_thread and current_thread","short":"Runtime","main":"Work stealing vs. a single thread.","body":[{"t":"scene","labels":["multi_thread","Work-stealing","current_thread"],"captions":["Worker thread pool (one per core); each has a local task queue","An idle thread steals tasks from neighbors; LIFO slot for the last woken task","One thread: simpler, more predictable, no Send; for tests and small tools"],"frames":[[{"t":"cell","id":"t0","x":60.0,"y":66.0,"w":66.0,"h":34.0,"text":"thread 1","tone":"green","size":10.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"t1","x":140.0,"y":66.0,"w":66.0,"h":34.0,"text":"thread 2","tone":"green","size":10.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"t2","x":220.0,"y":66.0,"w":66.0,"h":34.0,"text":"thread 3","tone":"green","size":10.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"t3","x":300.0,"y":66.0,"w":66.0,"h":34.0,"text":"thread 4","tone":"green","size":10.0,"sub_size":8.5}],[{"t":"cell","id":"a","x":90.0,"y":60.0,"w":130.0,"h":34.0,"text":"thread 1: empty","tone":"yellow","size":10.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"line","id":"e","x1":156.0,"y1":60.0,"x2":204.0,"y2":60.0,"tone":"green","arrow":true,"width":1.6},{"t":"cell","id":"b","x":270.0,"y":60.0,"w":130.0,"h":34.0,"text":"thread 2: 5 tasks","tone":"blue","size":10.0,"sub_size":8.5}],[{"t":"cell","id":"a","x":180.0,"y":66.0,"w":200.0,"h":40.0,"text":"one thread, all tasks","tone":"green","size":12.0,"sub_size":8.5}]],"cues":[16.0,23.7]}]},{"title":"Builder and Handle","sub":"Manual setup","short":"Builder","main":"Builder, Handle::current, block_on.","body":[{"t":"scene","labels":["Builder","Handle","block_on"],"captions":["Builder::new_multi_thread().worker_threads(4).thread_name(\"w\").enable_all().build()","Handle::current() is a lightweight reference to the runtime: spawn tasks from plain threads","rt.block_on(fut) runs a future on the current thread; drop(rt) cancels tasks at the next .await"],"frames":[[{"t":"code","id":"c","x":20.0,"y":30.0,"lines":["let rt = Builder::new_multi_thread()","    .worker_threads(4)","    .enable_all()","    .build()?;"],"hl":[1,2],"lang":"rust","size":10.5,"lh":22.0,"w":340.0}],[{"t":"code","id":"c","x":20.0,"y":50.0,"lines":["let h = Handle::current();","std::thread::spawn(move || { h.spawn(async { … }); });"],"hl":[0],"lang":"rust","size":9.0,"lh":28.0,"w":340.0}],[{"t":"code","id":"c","x":20.0,"y":50.0,"lines":["let r = rt.block_on(async { 1 + 1 });"],"hl":[0],"lang":"rust","size":11.0,"lh":28.0,"w":340.0}]],"cues":[16.6,27.8]}]},{"title":"spawn","sub":"Tasks","short":"spawn","main":"JoinHandle, Send + 'static, JoinError.","body":[{"t":"scene","labels":["spawn → JoinHandle","Send + 'static","JoinError"],"captions":["tokio::spawn(fut) starts a task and returns JoinHandle<T>; drop the handle and the task keeps running","The future must be Send + 'static: everything inside it is owned by it",".await on the handle → Result<T, JoinError>: a task panic is isolated (is_panic), cancel is is_cancelled; abort(), is_finished()"],"frames":[[{"t":"code","id":"c","x":20.0,"y":50.0,"lines":["let h = tokio::spawn(async { 5 });","let v = h.await?;"],"hl":[0],"lang":"rust","size":11.0,"lh":28.0,"w":340.0}],[{"t":"cell","id":"pa","x":90.0,"y":60.0,"w":130.0,"h":34.0,"text":"Send","tone":"blue","size":10.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"pb","x":270.0,"y":60.0,"w":130.0,"h":34.0,"text":"'static","tone":"blue","size":10.0,"sub_size":8.5}],[{"t":"code","id":"c","x":20.0,"y":40.0,"lines":["match h.await {","    Ok(v) => …,","    Err(e) if e.is_panic() => …,","    Err(e) => …,   // is_cancelled","}"],"hl":[2],"lang":"rust","size":9.5,"lh":20.0,"w":340.0}]],"cues":[13.8,28.3]}]},{"title":"JoinSet","sub":"Task sets","short":"JoinSet","main":"join_next, abort_all, safe drop.","body":[{"t":"scene","labels":["Task set","join_next","Safe drop"],"captions":["JoinSet holds a set of independent tasks; spawn adds; like TaskGroup","join_next().await yields results as tasks finish; abort_all, shutdown; completion order","Dropping the set cancels all tasks, no leaks; for spawn order, attach an index"],"frames":[[{"t":"cell","id":"t0","x":80.0,"y":66.0,"w":80.0,"h":34.0,"text":"task 1","tone":"blue","size":10.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"t1","x":180.0,"y":66.0,"w":80.0,"h":34.0,"text":"task 2","tone":"blue","size":10.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"t2","x":280.0,"y":66.0,"w":80.0,"h":34.0,"text":"task 3","tone":"blue","size":10.0,"sub_size":8.5}],[{"t":"code","id":"c","x":20.0,"y":50.0,"lines":["while let Some(r) = set.join_next().await {","    let v = r?;","}"],"hl":[0],"lang":"rust","size":10.0,"lh":26.0,"w":340.0}],[{"t":"cell","id":"a","x":180.0,"y":60.0,"w":230.0,"h":34.0,"text":"drop(set) → abort all","tone":"yellow","size":12.0,"sub_size":8.5}]],"cues":[10.5,24.3]}]},{"title":"Blocking code","sub":"spawn_blocking","short":"Blocking","main":"spawn_blocking, block_in_place, tokio::fs.","body":[{"t":"scene","labels":["spawn_blocking","block_in_place","Files"],"captions":["Closure runs in a separate pool (up to 512 threads), result is a JoinHandle; cannot cancel once started","block_in_place turns the current worker into a blocking one — multi_thread only; heavy compute — rayon","tokio::fs uses the same pool inside: OSes have no uniform async file I/O"],"frames":[[{"t":"code","id":"c","x":20.0,"y":50.0,"lines":["let r = tokio::task::spawn_blocking(|| heavy()).await?;"],"hl":[0],"lang":"rust","size":9.0,"lh":28.0,"w":340.0}],[{"t":"code","id":"c","x":20.0,"y":50.0,"lines":["tokio::task::block_in_place(|| heavy());"],"hl":[0],"lang":"rust","size":11.0,"lh":28.0,"w":340.0}],[{"t":"cell","id":"pa","x":90.0,"y":60.0,"w":130.0,"h":34.0,"text":"tokio::fs","tone":"blue","size":10.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"pb","x":270.0,"y":60.0,"w":130.0,"h":34.0,"text":"spawn_blocking","tone":"green","size":10.0,"sub_size":8.5}]],"cues":[15.9,32.5]}]},{"title":"LocalSet","sub":"!Send tasks","short":"LocalSet","main":"spawn_local on one thread.","body":[{"t":"scene","labels":["!Send tasks","LocalSet","When"],"captions":["A task holding an Rc is not Send: tokio::spawn will reject it","LocalSet::new().run_until(async { spawn_local(…) }) — tasks on one thread","GUIs, thread-bound code; rare in servers — but fixes \"future is not Send\""],"frames":[[{"t":"cell","id":"pa","x":90.0,"y":60.0,"w":130.0,"h":34.0,"text":"Rc in a task","tone":"red","size":10.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"pb","x":270.0,"y":60.0,"w":130.0,"h":34.0,"text":"spawn ✕","tone":"red","size":10.0,"sub_size":8.5}],[{"t":"code","id":"c","x":20.0,"y":50.0,"lines":["let local = LocalSet::new();","local.run_until(async {","    tokio::task::spawn_local(async { … }).await","}).await;"],"hl":[2],"lang":"rust","size":9.0,"lh":22.0,"w":340.0}],[{"t":"cell","id":"a0","x":50.0,"y":66.0,"w":76.0,"h":30.0,"text":"GUI","tone":"blue","size":10.5,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"a1","x":136.0,"y":66.0,"w":76.0,"h":30.0,"text":"threads","tone":"blue","size":10.5,"sub_size":8.5}]],"cues":[14.6,26.6]}]},{"title":"task_local!","sub":"Task data","short":"task_local","main":"task_local!, task::id, tracing, tokio-console.","body":[{"t":"scene","labels":["task_local!","Task id","Observing"],"captions":["task_local! — a per-task value, like contextvars in Python; KEY.scope(v, fut) sets it for the future","tokio::task::id() — the task id","tracing and tokio-console show live tasks, poll and wait times: stuck tasks are visible"],"frames":[[{"t":"code","id":"c","x":20.0,"y":40.0,"lines":["tokio::task_local! { static REQ: u32; }","REQ.scope(7, async { REQ.get() }).await"],"hl":[1],"lang":"rust","size":9.0,"lh":28.0,"w":340.0}],[{"t":"code","id":"c","x":20.0,"y":50.0,"lines":["let id = tokio::task::id();"],"hl":[0],"lang":"rust","size":12.0,"lh":28.0,"w":340.0}],[{"t":"cell","id":"pa","x":90.0,"y":60.0,"w":130.0,"h":34.0,"text":"tracing","tone":"blue","size":10.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"pb","x":270.0,"y":60.0,"w":130.0,"h":34.0,"text":"tokio-console","tone":"green","size":10.0,"sub_size":8.5}]],"cues":[16.1,28.6]}]},{"title":"Cooperation","sub":"Budget","short":"Budget","main":"128 operations; compute without .await.","body":[{"t":"scene","labels":["Budget","Compute without .await","Rule"],"captions":["Each task has a budget: 128 operations; then the resource returns Pending itself and yields","A long loop without .await hogs the thread: use yield_now() or spawn_blocking","Between two .await points — no more than tens of microseconds of work"],"frames":[[{"t":"cell","id":"a","x":180.0,"y":66.0,"w":200.0,"h":40.0,"text":"budget: 128","tone":"green","size":12.0,"sub_size":8.5}],[{"t":"code","id":"c","x":20.0,"y":40.0,"lines":["loop {","    heavy_step();   // no .await — thread is busy","}"],"hl":[1],"bad":[1],"lang":"rust","size":10.5,"lh":26.0,"w":340.0}],[{"t":"cell","id":"a","x":180.0,"y":60.0,"w":230.0,"h":34.0,"text":"microseconds between .await","tone":"yellow","size":11.5,"sub_size":8.5}]],"cues":[7.6,29.7]}]},{"title":"Shutdown","sub":"Stopping","short":"Shutdown","main":"End of main, shutdown_timeout, Ctrl-C.","body":[{"t":"scene","labels":["End of main","shutdown_timeout","Ctrl-C"],"captions":["main returned — runtime destroyed, unfinished tasks cancelled, destructors run (Python only warns)","Await important tasks explicitly: JoinHandle, JoinSet; shutdown_timeout gives time to exit","tokio::signal::ctrl_c().await — a future that wakes on the signal: basis of graceful server shutdown"],"frames":[[{"t":"code","id":"c","x":20.0,"y":50.0,"lines":["#[tokio::main]","async fn main() {","    tokio::spawn(work());   // main exits → work cancelled","}"],"hl":[2],"lang":"rust","size":8.5,"lh":22.0,"w":340.0}],[{"t":"code","id":"c","x":20.0,"y":50.0,"lines":["rt.shutdown_timeout(Duration::from_secs(5));"],"hl":[0],"lang":"rust","size":10.0,"lh":28.0,"w":340.0}],[{"t":"code","id":"c","x":20.0,"y":50.0,"lines":["tokio::signal::ctrl_c().await?;"],"hl":[0],"lang":"rust","size":12.0,"lh":28.0,"w":340.0}]],"cues":[16.2,28.7]}]},{"title":"Tests","sub":"test-util","short":"Tests","main":"#[tokio::test], pause, advance; sandbox.","body":[{"t":"scene","labels":["#[tokio::test]","pause and advance","In the sandbox"],"captions":["A separate runtime per test; single-threaded by default — deterministic","test-util: time::pause() freezes time, advance(d) moves it forward — an hour-long test passes instantly","test-util is not enabled in our sandbox — exercises use real short pauses"],"frames":[[{"t":"code","id":"c","x":20.0,"y":50.0,"lines":["#[tokio::test]","async fn t() { … }"],"hl":[0],"lang":"rust","size":12.0,"lh":28.0,"w":340.0}],[{"t":"code","id":"c","x":20.0,"y":50.0,"lines":["tokio::time::pause();","tokio::time::advance(Duration::from_secs(3600)).await;"],"lang":"rust","size":9.0,"lh":28.0,"w":340.0}],[{"t":"cell","id":"a","x":180.0,"y":60.0,"w":230.0,"h":34.0,"text":"pauses of 5–50 ms","tone":"yellow","size":12.0,"sub_size":8.5}]],"cues":[17.7,27.4]}]},{"title":"Summary","sub":"What next","short":"Summary","main":"Next — time and select!.","body":[{"t":"scene","labels":["Remember","Cheat sheet","Next"],"captions":["tokio::main creates the runtime; Builder configures; Handle spawns from other threads; spawn → JoinHandle; JoinSet collects","spawn_blocking and block_in_place — for blocking code; LocalSet — for !Send; scheduling is cooperative; shutdown is explicit","Next chapter — time: sleep, interval, timeout, select!"],"f